h3><div class="sc-fulBNO esSzWf pf-890_ accordion_block pf-icon-right" data-scrolling="false" data-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion"><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kMriOJ erijsp pf-891_"><button type="button" class="sc-EROOM bobLsW pf-892_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="d5d9614d-0116-454b-81ea-8b2047b383cf" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Is ThePhotoStick Omni easy to use?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="d5d9614d-0116-454b-81ea-8b2047b383cf" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dNsUpz jffPhP pf-894_"><p class="sc-ijDPxU cQGXXL pf-895_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-897_">Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <b><a href="https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/" target="_blank">User Guide</a></b> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kMriOJ erijsp pf-898_"><button type="button" class="sc-EROOM bobLsW pf-899_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="dbcfb505-73c6-46d7-89dd-71237975140a" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Which devices are compatible with ThePhotostick Omni?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="dbcfb505-73c6-46d7-89dd-71237975140a" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dNsUpz jffPhP pf-901_"><p class="sc-ijDPxU cQGXXL pf-902_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-904_">Almost all major Android, iPhone, and iPad devices!<br><br>It's compatible with Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and later<br>- Android: 6.0 and later*<i><br></i><sup>*ThePhotoStick Omni is NOT compatible with Google Pixel smartphones.<br></sup><br>For more up to date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our <a href="/pages/support-system-requirements" target="_self">System Requirements</a> page.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kMriOJ erijsp pf-905_"><button type="button" class="sc-EROOM bobLsW pf-906_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="30120d2d-a88b-45aa-90bf-d66a4e9e76eb" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How many photos can I store on ThePhotoStick Omni?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="30120d2d-a88b-45aa-90bf-d66a4e9e76eb" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dNsUpz jffPhP pf-908_"><p class="sc-ijDPxU cQGXXL pf-909_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-911_">Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick USB:<br><br>32 GB - 12,800 photos<br>64 GB - 25,600 photos<br>128 GB - 51,200 photos<br>256 GB - 102,400 photos<br>512 GB - 204,800 photos<br><br>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kMriOJ erijsp pf-912_"><button type="button" class="sc-EROOM bobLsW pf-913_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="caaaf370-02bf-4121-bfc1-d440405d4ab1" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>What photo and video files types can ThePhotoStick Omni find and save?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="caaaf370-02bf-4121-bfc1-d440405d4ab1" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dNsUpz jffPhP pf-915_"><p class="sc-ijDPxU cQGXXL pf-916_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-918_">Nearly all of them! It saves your standard JPEG, HEIC, PNG, GIF, MOV, and MPEG4, but it also saves a vast array of file types as listed below:<br><br><b>PHOTO EXTENSIONS:<br></b>- JPEG (*.jpg;*.jpeg;*.jpe;*.jfif)<br>- HEIC (*.heic, *.heics, *.heif, *.heifs, *.avci, *.avcs)<br>- GIF (*.gif)
- PNG (*.png)<br>- BMP (*.bmp;*.rle;*.dib)<br>- TIFF (*.tif,*.tiff)<br>- ICO (*.ico)<br>- Camera Raw (*.crw, *.nef, *.raf, *.orf, *.mrw, *.dcr, *.mos, *.raw, *.pef, *.srf, *.dng, *.x3f, *.cr2, *.erf, *.sr2, *.kdc, *.mfw, *.mef, *.arw, *.nrw, *.rw2, *.rwl, *.iiq, *.3fr, *.srw)<br>- Photoshop (*.psd, *.pdd, *.pdp, *.pse, *.eps)<br>- PICT File (*.PCT, *.PICT)<br><br><b>VIDEO EXTENSIONS:</b><br>- MOV (*.mov, *.qt, *.hevc)<br>- MPEG4 (*.mp4, *.mpeg4, *.m4v, *.h264)<br>- AVI (*.avi)<br>- WMV (*.wmv)<br>
</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kMriOJ erijsp pf-919_"><button type="button" class="sc-EROOM bobLsW pf-920_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="740f6c6a-46ca-4dc5-ac4d-73239e9b3d16" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I use ThePhotoStick Omni as an ongoing backup solution?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="740f6c6a-46ca-4dc5-ac4d-73239e9b3d16" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dNsUpz jffPhP pf-922_"><p class="sc-ijDPxU cQGXXL pf-923_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-925_">Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people plug ThePhotoStick® Omni in each night for a quick and easy backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kMriOJ erijsp pf-926_"><button type="button" class="sc-EROOM bobLsW pf-927_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="0aaf4332-6834-4993-b257-95bd0f836af7" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Does ThePhotoStick Omni come with tech support?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="0aaf4332-6834-4993-b257-95bd0f836af7" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dNsUpz jffPhP pf-929_"><p class="sc-ijDPxU cQGXXL pf-930_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-932_">Of course! Visit our website, www.thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kMriOJ erijsp pf-933_"><button type="button" class="sc-EROOM bobLsW pf-934_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="3936d5f6-f775-492e-aaa5-0a661df92e1d" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How does the 30 Day Money Back Guarantee work?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="3936d5f6-f775-492e-aaa5-0a661df92e1d" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dNsUpz jffPhP pf-936_"><p class="sc-ijDPxU cQGXXL pf-937_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-939_">We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, we are happy to help you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kMriOJ erijsp pf-940_"><button type="button" class="sc-EROOM bobLsW pf-941_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="d633420a-1981-49ba-b037-10da8628d923" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Will I have to pay any additional customs, duties or VAT fees when I receive my order?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="d633420a-1981-49ba-b037-10da8628d923" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dNsUpz jffPhP pf-943_"><p class="sc-ijDPxU cQGXXL pf-944_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-946_">Depending on your country, it is possible that you will be charged one or more of these fees when you receive your order. </span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-e852" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-cTTcKX hhkTci pf-947_ pf-color-scheme-1 pf-bg-lazy"><div style="--cw:1300px" class="sc-gplwNw fEopdE"><div class="sc-hZDzol kRuHOG pf-948_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position